msgid "%d devices"
msgstr "%d 台设备"

msgid "%d dropped"
msgstr "丢弃 %d 个"

msgid "%d in software"
msgstr "%d 个走软件限速"

msgid "%s down"
msgstr "下行 %s"

msgid "%s matches no rule"
msgstr "%s 未匹配任何规则"

msgid "%s up"
msgstr "上行 %s"

msgid "A hardware queue only limits what leaves through the wired ports, so on a bridge with a radio it misses the Wi-Fi clients. Automatic moves download shaping to software when it finds a radio, which costs the hardware offload for the devices that have a rule."
msgstr "硬件队列只能限制从有线端口发出的流量，因此在带有无线电的桥接上会漏掉 Wi-Fi 客户端。自动模式发现无线电时把下载限速改为软件实现，代价是已配置规则的设备失去硬件卸载。"

msgid "A profile sets the rates for every device that uses it, replacing what the device rule says. Share it and all members sit on one queue, splitting the bandwidth between them. Leave it unshared and each member gets the full rates."
msgstr "配置文件为所有使用它的设备设定速率，覆盖设备规则中的取值。开启共享后全部成员共用一个队列，彼此分摊带宽；不共享时每个成员各自获得完整速率。"

msgid "A rule written on a MAC address needs the host to show up at least once before the service can turn it into something nftables can match. These rules are waiting for that, and they carry no traffic until it happens."
msgstr "按 MAC 地址编写的规则需要该主机至少出现过一次，服务才能把它转换成 nftables 可以匹配的内容。这些规则正在等待，在此之前不承载任何流量。"

msgid "AF41, interactive video"
msgstr "AF41，交互式视频"

