msgid "Hardware queues"
msgstr "硬件队列"

msgid "High"
msgstr "高"

msgid "How a packet finds its queue when shaping runs in software. In the packet the firewall writes the queue into the packet itself and the scheduler reads it straight away, which is the cheaper path on a router with few cores. Mirrored copies every frame onto a second device and walks a list of filters on both, which is what earlier versions did."
msgstr "软件限速时数据包如何找到自己的队列。写入包内表示由防火墙把队列直接写进数据包，调度器随即读取，在核心数不多的路由器上开销更小。镜像方式会把每一帧复制到另一个设备，并在两边各走一遍过滤器列表，这是早期版本的做法。"

msgid "How many packets a flow has to carry before the accelerator takes it over. The service writes the same value to the turboacc configuration."
msgstr "一条流需要传输多少个数据包后才由加速引擎接管。服务会把同一取值写入 turboacc 配置。"

msgid "How the four priority levels split the line under weighted round robin. What counts is the distance between them: at 15 against 1, a critical queue gets fifteen times the share of a low one when both want more than there is. Strict priority ignores these."
msgstr "加权轮询模式下四个优先级如何瓜分带宽。真正起作用的是它们之间的差距：15 比 1 时，当两者都想要更多带宽，关键队列得到的份额是低优先级队列的十五倍。严格优先级模式忽略这些数值。"

msgid "IPv4 address"
msgstr "MAC 地址"

msgid "IPv6 address"
msgstr "MAC 地址"

msgid "In the packet"
msgstr "写入包内"

msgid "IoT"
msgstr "物联网"

msgid "Keeps this profile on a fixed queue instead of letting the service choose. Use 1 to %d for a hardware queue, or %d and above for software shaping. The numbers in between belong to the queues that carry everything else."
msgstr "把此配置文件固定在指定队列，而不是由服务自行选择。1 到 %d 为硬件队列，%d 及以上走软件限速。中间的数字属于承载其余流量的队列。"

msgid "Keeps this rule on a fixed queue instead of letting the service choose. A service rule always needs a hardware queue, so the value has to be %d or below."
msgstr "把此规则固定在指定队列，而不是由服务自行选择。1 到 %d 为硬件队列，%d 及以上走软件限速。中间的数字属于承载其余流量的队列。"

msgid "Keeps this rule on a fixed queue instead of letting the service choose. Use 1 to %d for a hardware queue, or %d and above for software shaping. The numbers in between belong to the queues that carry everything else."
msgstr "把此规则固定在指定队列，而不是由服务自行选择。1 到 %d 为硬件队列，%d 及以上走软件限速。中间的数字属于承载其余流量的队列。"

msgid "Leave both times empty and the rule is always on. A window that ends before it starts runs through the night, so 22:00 to 07:00 is one stretch and not two."
msgstr "两个时间都留空则规则始终生效。结束时间早于开始时间表示跨越午夜，因此 22:00 到 07:00 是连续的一段，而不是两段。"

msgid "Leave it empty and the rule watches the whole network. Fill it in and it only applies to the devices listed, which is how one phone gets its calls sorted without doing the same for everybody."
msgstr "留空则规则作用于整个网络。填写后只对列出的设备生效，这样可以只为某一部手机的通话排队，而不影响其他设备。"

msgid "Leave it empty for every day."
msgstr "留空表示每天。"

msgid "Leave it empty to use the device of the wan interface."
msgstr "留空则使用 wan 接口对应的设备。"

msgid "Limits are being enforced and the accelerator is running."
msgstr "限制已生效，加速引擎正在运行。"

msgid "Limits are being enforced in software only, the accelerator is not running."
msgstr "限制仅由软件执行，加速引擎未运行。"

msgid "Limits the line as a whole, and each device on its own. The per-device limits run in software, so they work for Wi-Fi clients as well. Traffic that no rule matches goes to the hardware queues."
msgstr "既限制整条线路，也单独限制每台设备。按设备的限速由软件实现，因此对 Wi-Fi 客户端同样有效。未匹配任何规则的流量走硬件队列。"

msgid "Low"
msgstr "低"

