msgstr "匹配方式"

msgid "Matches"
msgstr "匹配"

msgid "Mirrored"
msgstr "镜像"

msgid "Monday"
msgstr "星期一"

msgid "Network speed control service for MediaTek HNAT."
msgstr "面向 MediaTek HNAT 的网速控制服务。"

msgid "No acceleration"
msgstr "未启用加速"

msgid "No device rule is active."
msgstr "没有生效的设备规则。"

msgid "No limits"
msgstr "不限速"

msgid "No service rule is active."
msgstr "没有生效的服务规则。"

msgid "Normal"
msgstr "普通"

msgid "Off, the rule only picks up traffic that no device rule matched. On, it also takes traffic from devices that have a limit, and that traffic leaves their limit behind: give the rule a ceiling of its own or it ends up with none."
msgstr "关闭时，规则只接管没有被任何设备规则匹配的流量。开启时，它也会接管已有限速设备的流量，而这部分流量将脱离该设备的限速：请给规则设置自己的上限，否则它就完全不受限制了。"

msgid "Only numbers, hyphens and commas."
msgstr "只能填数字、连字符和逗号。"

msgid "Only these devices"
msgstr "仅这些设备"

msgid "Override device limits"
msgstr "覆盖设备限速"

msgid "Packets the queue had to throw away because it was full."
msgstr "队列已满而不得不丢弃的数据包。"

msgid "Ports"
msgstr "端口"

msgid "Priority"
msgstr "优先级"

msgid "Profile"
msgstr "配置档"

msgid "Profiles"
msgstr "配置档"

msgid "Protocol"
msgstr "协议"

