msgstr "队列编号"

msgid "Queue discipline"
msgstr "已用队列"

msgid "Queues in use"
msgstr "已用队列"

msgid "Remote desktop"
msgstr "远程桌面"

msgid "Replaces the section name when you pick the profile."
msgstr "选择配置文件时用它代替配置节名称显示。"

msgid "Replaces the weight that comes with the priority level, from 1 to %d. Strict priority ignores it."
msgstr "覆盖优先级自带的权重，取值 1 到 %d。严格优先级模式忽略此项。"

msgid "Saturday"
msgstr "星期六"

msgid "Schedule"
msgstr "调度算法"

msgid "Scheduling"
msgstr "调度算法"

msgid "Service"
msgstr "服务"

msgid "Service rules"
msgstr "服务规则"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Share bandwidth"
msgstr "共享带宽"

msgid "Software on the LAN bridge"
msgstr "LAN 网桥上的软件限速"

msgid "Software on the WAN device"
msgstr "WAN 设备上的软件限速"

msgid "Sorts traffic by what it carries instead of by who sends it, so a call keeps its place in the queue whichever device places it. By default they only pick up traffic that no device rule matched, so the per-device limits stay intact. A rule can be told to take precedence, and then that traffic leaves the limit of its device."
msgstr "按流量本身的内容分类，而不是按发送它的设备，因此无论用哪台设备拨打，通话都能保住自己的队列位置。默认情况下规则只接管没有被任何设备规则匹配的流量，因此按设备的限速保持不变。也可以让某条规则优先，届时那部分流量将脱离所属设备的限速。"

msgid "Speed in Mbit/s the scheduler keeps for this queue. Leave it at 0 to set only a ceiling."
msgstr "调度器为此队列保留的速率，单位 Mbit/s。保持 0 表示只设上限。"

msgid "Speed in kbit/s a queue keeps when it asked for no guarantee and everything else is busy. Raise it to stop low priority devices from being squeezed to nothing, lower it to give the high priority ones more room."
msgstr "队列未申请保障且其他队列繁忙时仍能保留的速率，单位 kbit/s。调高可避免低优先级设备被压到几乎为零，调低则给高优先级设备更多空间。"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Streaming"
msgstr "流媒体"

msgid "Strict priority"
msgstr "严格优先级"

msgid "Sunday"
msgstr "星期日"

msgid "TCP"
msgstr "TCP"

msgid "TCP and UDP"
msgstr "TCP 和 UDP"

msgid "The class the device writes into its own packets, which is the only handle left when a service moves to a port nobody published. Phones and softphones usually mark voice as EF."
msgstr "设备自己写入数据包的类别。当服务换到未公布的端口时，这是唯一可用的判据。话机和软电话通常把语音标记为 EF。"

msgid "The devices that take this profile. Adding one here creates its rule for you, removing one deletes that rule."
msgstr "使用此配置文件的设备。在这里添加会自动创建对应的规则，移除则删除该规则。"

msgid "The hardware queues can shape upload only when the traffic reaches the QDMA scheduler, and that never happens on an external WAN device. Automatic switches to software shaping when it finds one."
msgstr "只有当流量到达 QDMA 调度器时硬件队列才能限制上传，而外接 WAN 设备上永远不会发生。自动模式遇到这种情况时改用软件限速。"

msgid "The ports the service listens on, separated by commas. A range is written with a hyphen, as in 10000-20000. Leave it empty to take the whole protocol."
msgstr "服务监听的端口，用逗号分隔。区间用连字符书写，例如 10000-20000。留空则匹配整个协议。"

msgid "The rule follows the device when its address changes, because a new DHCP lease reloads it."
msgstr "设备地址变化时规则会跟随，因为新的 DHCP 租约会重新加载规则。"

msgid "The service assigns the queues itself, starting from the highest priority. When no hardware queue is left, the rule falls back to software shaping."
msgstr "服务自行分配队列，从最高优先级开始。硬件队列用完后，规则退回软件限速。"

msgid "The service is off and no limit is being enforced."
msgstr "服务已关闭，没有任何限制生效。"

msgid "Thursday"
msgstr "星期四"

msgid "Top speed in Mbit/s. Use 0 to leave it unlimited."
msgstr "最高速率，单位 Mbit/s。填 0 表示不限制。"

msgid "Total download speed of the line. Set it a little below what the line really delivers, around 95%, or the scheduler never becomes the bottleneck and priorities have nothing to arbitrate. Traffic that no device rule matches gets this as its limit."
msgstr "线路的下载总速率。请设成略低于线路实际能跑到的速度，大约 95%，否则调度器永远不会成为瓶颈，优先级也就无从仲裁。未匹配任何设备规则的流量以此为上限。"

msgid "Total upload speed of the line. Set it a little below what the line really delivers, around 95%, or the scheduler never becomes the bottleneck and priorities have nothing to arbitrate. Traffic that no device rule matches gets this as its limit."
msgstr "线路的上传总速率。请设成略低于线路实际能跑到的速度，大约 95%，否则调度器永远不会成为瓶颈，优先级也就无从仲裁。未匹配任何设备规则的流量以此为上限。"

msgid "Traffic"
msgstr "流量"

msgid "Traffic by device"
msgstr "按设备的流量"

msgid "Traffic by service"
msgstr "按服务的流量"

msgid "Tuesday"
msgstr "星期二"

msgid "UDP"
msgstr "UDP"

msgid "Upload"
msgstr "当前上传"

msgid "Upload now"
msgstr "当前上传"

msgid "Upload only"
msgstr "仅上传"

msgid "Upload shaping"
msgstr "上传限速方式"

msgid "Upload shaping in hardware starts only when the WAN device name begins with the one the accelerator knows about, so it never runs when the WAN is an external device."
msgstr "只有当 WAN 设备名以加速引擎已知的名称开头时，硬件上传限速才会生效，因此 WAN 是外接设备时它永远不会启动。"

msgid "Use the rates and the priority of a profile instead of setting them here."
msgstr "使用某个配置文件的速率和优先级，而不是在这里单独设置。"

msgid "Use the rates and the priority of a profile instead of setting them here. The rule still gets a queue of its own, since it is not a device."
msgstr "使用某个配置文件的速率和优先级，而不是在这里单独设置。规则仍会分到自己的队列，因为它不是一台设备。"

msgid "Video calls"
msgstr "视频通话"

msgid "Video meetings"
msgstr "视频会议"

msgid "VoIP"
msgstr "VoIP"

msgid "Voice calls"
msgstr "语音通话"

msgid "WAN device"
msgstr "WAN 设备"

msgid "Wednesday"
msgstr "星期三"

msgid "Weight"
msgstr "权重"

msgid "Weight of critical"
msgstr "关键的权重"

msgid "Weight of high"
msgstr "权重"

msgid "Weight of low"
msgstr "权重"

msgid "Weight of normal"
msgstr "普通的权重"

msgid "Weighted round robin"
msgstr "加权轮询"

msgid "Weighted round robin splits the line between the queues by weight. Strict priority always serves the highest queue first."
msgstr "加权轮询按权重在各队列之间分配线路。严格优先级总是先服务最高的队列。"

msgid "What sits at the bottom of each queue. It does not change the rates, it decides how long a packet waits once a queue starts to fill. Automatic takes cake where the kernel has it and falls back to fq_codel."
msgstr "每个队列底部使用的算法。它不改变速率，只决定队列开始堆积后数据包要等多久。自动模式在内核提供 cake 时使用 cake，否则回退到 fq_codel。"

msgid "Whichever address you pick, the rule also covers the other addresses of the same host, so a device limited through its IPv4 lease is limited over IPv6 as well."
msgstr "无论选择哪个地址，规则同样覆盖同一主机的其他地址，因此通过 IPv4 租约限速的设备在 IPv6 上也一样受限。"

msgid "Work"
msgstr "办公"

msgid "Write the time as HH:MM."
msgstr "时间请写成 HH:MM 格式。"

